      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Rung 1 \u2014 the manual SDK\nEverything here is a line of code somebody wrote. The span name `handle_request`, both attributes, and the counter.\n\n**Open a trace and look at the attribute list** \u2014 then compare it with demo 2. This one is pinned to semconv **v1.26.0**, so it still emits the deprecated `http.method` and the non-existent `http.path`."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "What rung 1 costs: the SDK setup and the per-request code are both yours to write."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces \u2014 click one to open the waterfall",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"demo1-manual-sdk\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "description": "Spans written by hand. Two things to notice: the kind is INTERNAL, not SERVER, and only 2 attributes were set."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "demo1.requests \u2014 the one hand-written counter",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(demo1_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "description": "The single counter in the source. It counts requests and can never tell you how slow they were."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Counter rate, by the one attribute we bothered to set",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_method) (rate(demo1_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_method}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
