      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "description": "The same counter, split by the one attribute the code bothered to set. No route, no status code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What is missing\nNo latency histogram. No status code. No route. No request or response size. **Not because the SDK cannot do it** \u2014 because nobody wrote those lines."
      },
      "id": 5,
      "description": "What a hand-written counter cannot give you, no matter how carefully it is written."
    }
  ]
